n.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ooh, interesting. I can see a lot of potential with those.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-25T18:19:13-07:00","id":1327511,"title":"","content":"So like idealized past versus idealized future? That sounds interesting","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24769-magicjohnny","name":"Magicjohnny","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24769_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-27T22:35:50-07:00","id":1327853,"title":"","content":"A bit of Orisha overlap there, but no more so than multiple other pantheons having variants of \u201cbeing a good person\u201d vs \u201cbeing a good member of society\u201d as their Virtues create overlap with each other.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpa